flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[New job submissions]
    B --> C[Estimate job duration from historical data]
    C --> D[Queue ordered by estimated duration]
    D --> E{History available?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Select shortest-estimated job]
    E -->|No| G[Fallback: select by submission order]
    F --> H[Assign to available worker]
    G --> H
    H --> I([End])
